WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,780
My car

2
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,560
Fortunately, there is another one

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,080
This SUV should still be drivable after some repairs.

4
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,840
It’s better to have money

5
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:21,200
The windows of Mr. Ba’s car are probably bulletproof.

6
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,700
You have to find the materials first

7
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,820
See if there are any usable ones on those plum and bamboo cars.

8
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,690
We must seize the time to search and distribute supplies.

9
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:50,650
It's good and bad that no one pays attention here

10
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:54,620
It’s been so miserable without fresh vegetables for just a few days.
